---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "FECO (Full Extract Cannabis Oil)"
letter: "F"
anchor: "feco"
category: "edibles"
---

A highly concentrated cannabis extract made by evaporating all the alcohol from a tincture, leaving behind a thick, dark, potent oil containing cannabinoids, terpenes, and other plant compounds. FECO is among the most potent cannabis products you can make at home — a small amount, sometimes the size of a grain of rice, represents a significant dose. Used medically, in capsules, as a high-potency cooking ingredient, or dissolved in MCT oil for a precise oil-based tincture.

→ [How to Make Cannabis Tincture](/edibles/how-to-make-cannabis-tincture-green-golden-dragon/)
